      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36566\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36566.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36566#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36482](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36482) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36482.svg\"></sub> (wallet: Only broadcast resubmitted transactions that were added to the mempool by achow101)\n* [#36429](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36429) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36429.svg\"></sub> ([RFC] Delayed transaction broadcast, minimal by optout21)\n* [#36384](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36384) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36384.svg\"></sub> (rpc: Use self.Arg<_>(name) helper over manual and duplicate parsing by maflcko)\n* [#36167](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36167) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36167.svg\"></sub> ([RFC] Enable `-Wunused` by fanquake)\n* [#36002](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36002) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36002.svg\"></sub> (txindex: allow running in pruned mode by andrewtoth)\n* [#35728](https://github.com/bitcoin/bit